### 1. Get all notes
GET http://localhost:8080/notes/getNotes
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create a note
POST http://localhost:8080/notes/postNotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Spring Boot",
  "content": "Build REST APIs"
}

### 3. Get a note by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/notes/1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Delete a note
DELETE http://localhost:8080/notes/1